post.description:
Call this API after changing any product attribute to get the updated price and stock info for that attribute.

Sample Scenario: Price of the red shirt is $20 but price of the blue shirt is $25.

Path: Product ID

Format of request body:

{
  "FormValues": [
    {
      "Key": "product_attribute_{id of attribute}",
      "Value": "{id of selected value}"
    }
  ]
}

Update an item quantity of shopping cart.

Values In Post Body: 
{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "itemquantity{Cart Product Item Id}",
            "Value": "{Updated Quantity}"
        }
    ]
}

This API is called for applying a discount coupon.

Values In Post Body:

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "discountcouponcode",
            "Value": "{Discount Coupon Code}"
        }
    ]
}

By Using this API, custumer can remove discount coupon.

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "removediscount-{Discount Id}",
            "Value": "{Discount Coupon Code}"
        }
    ]
}

By using this API, user sends currently selected dynamic attributes.

Values In Post Body:

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "checkout_attribute_{Id of CheckoutAttribute}",
            "Value": "{Id of Value (selected attribute)}"
        }
    ]
}

This API is called for applying a Gift Card coupon.

Values In Post Body:

{ "FormValues": [ { "Key": "giftcardcouponcode", "Value": "{Gift Card Coupon Code}" } ] }

This API is called for removing a Gift Card coupon.

Values In Post Body:

{ "FormValues": [ { "Key": "removegiftcard-{Gift Card Id}", "Value": "{Gift Card Coupon Code}" } ] }

This API is used for selecting a billing address from existing billing address list.

Values In Post Body:

{
    "Data": {
        "PickupInStore": false,
        "ShipToSameAddress": false
    },
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "billing_address_id",
            "Value": "{Existing Billing Address Id}"
        }
    ]
}

Used for saving a store address as shipping address

Format of request body:

NopCommerce 4.2 -

{
    "Data": {
        "PickupInStore": true
    },
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "pickup-points-id",
            "Value": "{store id}___Pickup.PickupInStore"
        }
    ]
}

NopCommerce 4.3 -

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "pickup-points-id",
            "Value": "{store id}___Pickup.PickupInStore"
        },
        {
            "Key": "PickupInStore",
            "Value": "true"
        }
    ]
}

This API is used for selecting shipping method from a list of shipping methods from server.

Values In Post Body:

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "shippingoption",
            "Value": "{Name}___{ShippingRateComputationMethodSystemName}"
        }
    ]
}

This API is used for selecting payment method from a list of payment methods from server.

Values In Post Body:

{
    "FormValues": [
        {
            "Key": "paymentmethod",
            "Value": "{PaymentMethodSystemName}"
        },
        {
            "Key": "UseRewardPoints",
            "Value": "true"
        }
    ]
}
